# Strata SDK: Multi-Page Forms — Views & Locales

The `strata:application_form_views` generator scaffolds all view templates, the shared layout, and locale files for a multi-page form flow in one command.

## Views Generator Usage

```bash
bin/rails generate strata:application_form_views LeaveApplicationFlow LeaveApplicationForm
```

This generates one ERB template per question page, a shared form layout with task-list sidebar and progress indicator, and a locale file pre-populated with placeholder labels and hint text for every page.

## Generated Files

- `app/views/leave_application_forms/edit_<page_name>.html.erb` — one template per question page; renders the field(s) for that page inside `strata_form_with`.
- `app/views/layouts/leave_application_form.html.erb` — shared layout wrapping all question-page views; includes the task-list sidebar and step progress component.
- `config/locales/leave_application_forms/en.yml` — labels, hints, legend text, and error message keys for every page field, ready to customise.

## Template Helpers

- `strata_form_with` — form builder helper pre-scoped to the flow record and current page.
- `@flow` — the flow class for the current request.
- `@flow_task` — the current `Task` instance.
- `@flow_page` — the current `QuestionPage` instance.
- `@flow_task.next_path` — URL to the next page in the task (used for back/continue links).
- `@flow_task.prev_path` — URL to the previous page in the task.
## Task List Component

`Strata::Flows::TaskListComponent` is a ViewComponent class (not a bare template helper) that renders the full task list sidebar with status badges (not started / in progress / complete / locked). Render it explicitly in templates or layouts:

```erb
<%%= render Strata::Flows::TaskListComponent.new(flow: @flow) %>
```

The `flow:` keyword argument must receive an instantiated flow object (e.g., `@flow` set by the controller). An optional `show_step_label:` boolean toggles the step-number label on each task section.

## Shared Partials, Index/Show Templates, and I18n Keys

Shared partials (`strata/shared/form_buttons`, `strata/shared/step_indicator`, `strata/shared/exit_link`), index/show view templates, and the full I18n key table are documented in `strata-application-form/views.md`. That rule auto-loads on application form view files and covers conventions shared between single-page and multi-page forms.

